        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists have some exciting news about the Amazon "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rainforest",
            "ref": "v-rainforest"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—its trees are getting bigger!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A new study shows that trees in the forest have been growing about 3% larger every ten years. That may not sound like much, but across millions of trees, it’s huge! The reason may be that there is more carbon dioxide in the air, which plants use to grow. “This is good news,” said one scientist. “The trees are still healthy and growing.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But there are still problems. People are cutting down trees, and the weather is getting hotter. These changes can hurt the forest."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Amazon is the biggest rainforest in the world. It is home to thousands of animals and plants. It is often called the “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lungs of the Earth",
            "zh": "地球之肺"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "” because it helps clean the air we breathe. Its trees take in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "carbon dioxide",
            "ref": "v-carbon-dioxide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and give out "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "oxygen",
            "ref": "v-oxygen"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Scientists say we must protect it before it’s too late."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
